<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/10/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Subordinate Courts Rules Act 1955 [Act 55], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in section 2 by inserting after the definition of “proceeding” the following definition: ‘ “remote communication technology” means a live video link, a live television link or any other electronic means of communication;’. Amendment of section 3"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/10/eng@/~cl_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/10/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/10/eng@> .
